{
  "title": "Nourishing Bitter British Lamb Shepherds Pie",
  "description": "A traditional British dish with a twist, featuring bitter lamb and sweet pineapple, perfect for a brunch mood, this high protein friendly shepherds pie is a must try for anyone looking for a hearty meal.",
