  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375 degrees.",
    "In a large pan, cook the lamb mince over medium heat until browned.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, peas, and pineapple chunks to the pan and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Stir in the flour and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Gradually add the beef broth to the pan, stirring constantly, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "In a separate pot, boil the potatoes until tender, then mash with butter and beaten egg.",
    "Transfer the lamb mixture to a baking dish and top with the mashed potato.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 25 minutes, or until the potato is golden brown."
